# HedakTuk App - MVP Launch Plan

For an MVP launch, the priority order is:

## 1. Customer App (UI & UX)
Without this, there's no business.
- [x] Expo Setup & Configuration
- [x] Navigation Structure (Tabs & Stack)
- [x] Global Theme & Styling (dark/light mode with Zustand)
- [x] Home Screen (`index.tsx`) — connected to real API
- [x] Restaurant Screen (`[id].tsx`) — connected to real API
- [x] Search Screen (`search.tsx`) — UI done, uses mock data
- [x] Menu & Cart Management (`cart.tsx`, `cartStore.ts`) — local Zustand only
- [x] Orders History (`orders.tsx`) — UI done, uses hardcoded mock data
- [x] Profile Screen (`profile.tsx`) — UI done, fully static
- [x] Checkout & Payments UI (`checkout.tsx`) — UI done, API call built (has a bug: `cartStore` not imported)
- [x] Live Order Tracking (`track/[id].tsx`) — UI done, simulates with setTimeout

